[00:12.49]Give me your eyes
[00:12.49]给予我你的双模
[00:15.40]Bringing in the morning
[00:15.40]能够唤醒清晨
[00:18.33]Give me sunrise
[00:18.33]给予我日出
[00:24.20]Give me your smile
[00:24.20]给予我你的笑容
[00:27.20]All your hidden corners
[00:27.20]你所有隐藏角落
[00:29.97]Give me surprise
[00:29.97]给予我惊喜
[00:34.84]Give me all your flaws and all your quirks
[00:34.84]给予我你所有的缺点怪癖
[00:37.88]How you braid your hair and tie your shirts
[00:37.88]看你如何编发如何系衣衫
[00:40.73]Give me how you laugh, how you hurt when you do
[00:40.73]你如何欢笑 如何在受伤时难堪
[00:46.58]Give me how you eat and how you run
[00:46.58]告诉我 你如何吃饭 如何奔跑
[00:49.52]Give me what you hate and how you love
[00:49.52]请让我一探究竟 你厌恶什么 如何去爱
[00:52.42]Give me what you hide away and think is uncool
[00:52.42]请给予我 你所隐藏的 认为不够酷的一切
[00:57.90]Give me all your fears
[00:57.90]给予我你所有恐惧
[01:00.81]Give me all your dreams
[01:00.81]给予我你所有梦想
[01:03.74]Give me all you're scared to lose
[01:03.74]给予我你害怕失去的一切
[01:09.56]Give me all your future
[01:09.56]给予我你所有未来
[01:12.54]Give me all your blues
[01:12.54]给予我你所有的忧郁
[01:15.40]In other words, give me all of you
[01:15.40]换句话说 给予我全部的你
[01:22.77]Give me your time
[01:22.77]给予我你的时间
[01:25.62]I'll take any moment
[01:25.62]每个瞬间 我都悉心珍藏
[01:28.52]My one for life
[01:28.52]我的此生唯一
[01:34.41]Give me your light
[01:34.41]给予我你的光明
[01:37.41]And give me your shadow
[01:37.41]还有你的阴影
[01:39.98]I'm right by your side
[01:39.98]我会在你身边不离不弃
[01:45.13]Give me how you kiss and how you shout
[01:45.13]让我探索 你会如何亲吻 如何大喊
[01:48.04]And leave your clothes around our house
[01:48.04]给予我随意丢在家中的衣服
[01:51.01]Give me how you check the locks before we both sleep
[01:51.01]还有睡前你再三检查门锁的习惯
[01:56.71]Give me your ideas and "Babe, come here"s
[01:56.71]你的奇思妙想 还有你那句“宝贝 过来”
[01:59.85]And all your sad and happy tears
[01:59.85]你所有悲伤 以及开心的泪珠
[02:02.60]And how without your breakfast tea you're incomplete
[02:02.60]给予我那没有早茶就不完整的你
